Lineage and attribution
-----------------------
MengAI is a from-scratch rewrite that started from the "catcomp" project
(internally "Briworkers"): a multi-agent AI orchestration tool whose agents
were visualised as cats in an office. No source code from that project is
included in MengAI; its concepts (a crew of AI agents shown as cats, an
orchestrator that hires, delegates, reviews and reports) are credited here
as required by the original project's license, which permits modification
and upgrades as long as credit is kept.

Original project: catcomp / Briworkers (author: Brian, JAL Group).
If the upstream distribution carries a license notice of its own, that
notice applies to the concepts credited above and is to be kept alongside
this file.

